      "instance_name": "Trivialization_of_Holocaust",
      "label": "The act of trivializing the Holocaust and genocide",
      "description": "The meme equates a minor financial inconvenience with the rage of a historical dictator responsible for genocide. This is a form of Holocaust trivialization, which is deeply disrespectful to victims and survivors and can be seen as desensitizing to the gravity of historical crimes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_4ff223e2"
