      "instance_name": "Anti_Semitic_stereotype",
      "label": "Anti-Semitic stereotype of Jewish people as greedy or controlling financial resources",
      "description": "While not explicitly stated, the use of Hitler (a figure associated with anti-Semitic ideology) to express outrage over a financial bill can implicitly invoke the stereotype that Jewish people are greedy or control financial systems. This is a harmful and historically rooted antisemitic trope.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
