      "label": "Use of shock value and juxtaposition for comedic effect",
      "description": "The meme relies on the shock value created by juxtaposing a symbol of extreme historical evil with a mundane, relatable problem. This is a common internet meme trope, but in this case, it is particularly harmful due to the nature of the symbol used.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
