      "instance_name": "frustration",
      "label": "extreme frustration expression",
      "description": "The visual depiction of Adolf_Hitler with his right fist raised and mouth open in a shout, combined with the text 'when you see the gas bill', conveys an exaggerated and intense emotional state of frustration. This is not a natural human reaction to a gas bill, but a hyperbolic expression meant to shock and amplify the perceived magnitude of the financial burden.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
